[[32,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238155\">4130B98</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) and remove the mounting bracket for the power\nassisted steering fluid radiator (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018109.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[32,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the power assisted steering fluid\nradiator mounting bracket in its housing and secure it using the nuts.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238155\">4130B98</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]